// Transformer in Editor (§7.4): The rewritten node shown by the rewritten inspector
// calls the rule; editing the transformer rolls back its changes ( ), pause -
// rewrites the new rule.
//
// program: editor_transform.tz
open_view module
// expect:   a = 21 * 2;
// expect:   b = 5 * 2;
inspect 1 @21
// expect: kind="ast.operation" text="*" rule="переписан [[transform]] double_call(ast.call c)" rule_at=#
// The rule is no longer the same as the name - changes roll back immediately.
pointer 1 @"twice2" 0 1
key 1 x
// expect:   a = twice2(21);
// expect:   b = twice2(5);
// It's the same thing again.
key 1 Backspace
idle
// expect:   a = 21 * 2;
key 1 Escape
roundtrip
// expect: roundtrip: совпадает
